# ==============================================================================
# Rule Name: YouTube (Custom)
# Description: YouTube streaming services service endpoints
# Scope: YouTube web, app, video streams, thumbnails, and short links
# Architectural Boundary:
#   - Isolated from Google.lsr so YouTube media streams do not route to general Google egress
# Note: Core YouTube domains (youtube.com, googlevideo.com, etc.) are 100% covered by
#       mature upstream (190 rules in YouTube.lsr). This custom file is preserved for
#       verified gap additions and temporary exceptions.
# ==============================================================================
